<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:15:37Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>US asks China to uphold Busan trade deal commitments</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7fa87d59c31d3cd7caddef8485332d2d4e5ce82f13e401b51a80be8ddda0cb2e</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:15:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T04:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-asks-china-to-uphold-busan-trade-deal-commitments/a-79882939--7107d3b9b548.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-asks-china-to-uphold-busan-trade-deal-commitments/a-79882939?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US urged Beijing to meet commitments from a 2025 accord — particularly on agricultural purchases and rare earths supply. China, meanwhile, expressed concern over the US' "economic, trade restrictive" measures.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Cornell faculty declares 'no confidence' in university leadership</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2a902a619131bca652356bd6457905f30525108891701072fdad3260e2a6658c</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:15:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T03:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cornell-faculty-declares-no-confidence-in-university-leadership/a-79882895--89d8cf118513.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/cornell-faculty-declares-no-confidence-in-university-leadership/a-79882895?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The university leadership has faced intense criticism for its handling of sexual crimes on campus since a former student filed a lawsuit saying she was drugged and raped at a fraternity house in October 2024.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Paraguay: President Santiago Pena under house arrest over bank crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:654be4556c7061eaf25c71d1dafcabcd6e4bfac2cf2570b8be17f36e7b0df52d</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:15:35Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T23:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/paraguay-president-santiago-pena-under-house-arrest-over-bank-crisis/a-79868484--ca336b262c3b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/paraguay-president-santiago-pena-under-house-arrest-over-bank-crisis/a-79868484?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Paraguay’s Senate has ousted President Santiago Pena over the collapse of a major bank tied to his government. Millions of customers' accounts are frozen, with public pension and health care funds also tied up.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo arrives in Uruguay at start of South America tour</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d9132ae8b6ccb61d3c90e28fa1ca5d61411559de0a8481278b1281620ecc911d</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:15:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T22:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pope-leo-arrives-in-uruguay-at-start-of-south-america-tour/a-79872584--d522080c04d2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pope-leo-arrives-in-uruguay-at-start-of-south-america-tour/a-79872584?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo has arrived in Uruguay at the start of a 12-day trip through three South American nations. His trip, which is intense with a packed itinerary, comes just weeks after his lung cancer surgery.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Tankers carrying Russian diesel to the US change course</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1d76962162fd4716c74121ff8a2037c4ef66b2c18f64a8cee442c83a9c37f25c</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T20:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/tankers-carrying-russian-diesel-to-the-us-change-course/a-79870807--b4298bca46ea.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/tankers-carrying-russian-diesel-to-the-us-change-course/a-79870807?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Despite an ostensible deal between Donald Trump and Vladimir Putin to bring diesel to the US, tankers are reportedly unable to dock due to existing sanctions.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Stephen Miller named by Trump as new White House chief of staff</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2dbe395cd18d310e7c6aaef165e54df7caee96926e6645527cd0060754688c58</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T20:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/stephen-miller-named-by-trump-as-new-white-house-chief-of-staff/a-79881571--b75b041f5990.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/stephen-miller-named-by-trump-as-new-white-house-chief-of-staff/a-79881571?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Trump said he would be replacing Susie Wiles for the top advisory role. Miller is controversial figure, known as a key architect of the administration's hardline immigration policies.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ueno Bank scandal plunges Paraguay into political crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:be7e93cd526d837185bdae6c8a5fdecf9890fe99a0ab30f4f703e01ce59e223b</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T20:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ueno-bank-scandal-plunges-paraguay-into-political-crisis/a-79881388--35a7e5f2572b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ueno-bank-scandal-plunges-paraguay-into-political-crisis/a-79881388?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Suspected financial fraud, public money at risk and millions of customers affected: Paraguay is in serious crisis following the sudden collapse of Ueno Bank. President Santiago Pena is facing impeachment.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Critics say Democrats should look into Trump's Middle East deals in future corruption investigations</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:52de94fd6b3f826221ceafaf7dc2bb06ca0453e7439a0586c496d683479ed34e</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T19:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/critics-say-democrats-should-look-into-trump-s-middle-east-deals-in-future-corruption-investigations/a-79877104--54038fc6b2c6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/critics-say-democrats-should-look-into-trump-s-middle-east-deals-in-future-corruption-investigations/a-79877104?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After their victory in the US midterm elections, the Democrats have promised to investigate corruption in the Trump administration. Critics say the president's Middle East deals is an area they should focus on.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Ilse Aigner tipped by party allies as next German president</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4c5d7e967a87dbc91b5ef0a6e68ce26c8c409377d0565c203e1b9f704995b187</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T18:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ilse-aigner-tipped-by-party-allies-as-next-german-president/a-79880594--62497e57d523.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ilse-aigner-tipped-by-party-allies-as-next-german-president/a-79880594?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">German media reports suggest that Bavarian politician Ilse Aigner's chances of becoming the next president are on the up. Long favored by her Bavarian CSU, now it seems Christian Democrats nationwide plan to back her.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Meghan Markle's father arrested in US over child sex abuse material</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:995b6afa0907c9d1d70d6cbf9d3848508f2cad9fe96fe16b41e78ed639b71035</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T18:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/meghan-markle-s-father-arrested-in-us-over-child-sex-abuse-material/a-79879676--52fd50a72dc3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/meghan-markle-s-father-arrested-in-us-over-child-sex-abuse-material/a-79879676?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US federal agents arrested Thomas Markle in Florida. The Duchess of Sussex and television actress Meghan Markle, who is estranged from her father, said she was "deeply distressed" by the charges.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iran war: Gulf tanker attacked, 1 seaferer killed</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a1f48ae0bac87a0a866195aacd930351eb1a5a5aa08c9dbbf5c6e8f4992ef074</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T17:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-war-gulf-tanker-attacked-1-seaferer-killed/a-79879270--c5d5ff882e32.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-gulf-tanker-attacked-1-seaferer-killed/a-79879270?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Iran is stepping up attacks on shipping in the Persian Gulf and Strait of Hormuz. A Greek-owned tanker believed to have been struck with a missile, and Iran said two other vessels were on fire.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Tesla to 'wind down' production of flop Cybertruck</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:183d4b40ce2c1c5e8c467640c11194165de95448413245991c4560a8082ed035</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T17:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/tesla-to-wind-down-production-of-flop-cybertruck/a-79877759--ecdd4924ebad.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/tesla-to-wind-down-production-of-flop-cybertruck/a-79877759?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Elon Musk's electric pickup for the future will start to be consigned to the past next year. The Cybertruck's bulk and crude shape meant it could only pass regulatory standards in more permissive markets.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Data center protesters break into Microsoft site in Amsterdam</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b6caf7e6efabb47c99d8b5dc68eb49b1a41545e24fc37b1ba3cdef212f57b607</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T16:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/data-center-protesters-break-into-microsoft-site-in-amsterdam/a-79879050--b22520e31eb7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/data-center-protesters-break-into-microsoft-site-in-amsterdam/a-79879050?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Protesters are demanding a pause in data center construction in Europe. Campaigners planning protests in 16 countries say the AI building boom threatens water supplies, power grids and climate goals.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Despite Russia impasse, Germany still hoping to host Men's Ice Hockey World Championship</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1e81b4f8057841b955832f1d576b2c5223edfea6a6f120074677f83f459c57f5</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T16:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/despite-russia-impasse-germany-still-hoping-to-host-men-s-ice-hockey-world-championship/a-79879536--250e6f42c4f8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/despite-russia-impasse-germany-still-hoping-to-host-men-s-ice-hockey-world-championship/a-79879536?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A week after a court ruled that Russia must be allowed to return to international ice hockey, the way forward remains unclear. Berlin is seeking a solution that will allow Germany to host next year's Word Championship.</summary><category term="NRS-Import" /></entry><entry><title>Germany: Small plane crashes onto A2 highway, killing 2</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:806bf0d6048e293d387bdc841e85e920a0c8136b5a1359b0ab79db7f5d824968</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T16:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-small-plane-crashes-onto-a2-highway-killing-2/a-79878930--fda2d6a1e11f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-small-plane-crashes-onto-a2-highway-killing-2/a-79878930?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Two people have died after a small plane crashed onto Germany's A2 highway near Magdeburg. The crash closed the Hannover-bound lanes on a major east-west route, with no road vehicles reported to be involved.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Fact check: Three viral Iran war posts debunked</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:112341debdccffb0ebcba0f29623de20729ec3b690ad6ef4cdf5dc53366feb33</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T15:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/fact-check-three-viral-iran-war-posts-debunked/a-79867353--97b07015723a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/fact-check-three-viral-iran-war-posts-debunked/a-79867353?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After Monday's US attack on Iran, social media is awash with dramatic images and claims about renewed fighting. DW Fact Check found AI-generated and recycled videos — as well as misleading posts from dubious accounts.</summary><category term="TOP STORIES" /></entry><entry><title>Protests and reforms: France's rising debt costs threaten stability</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8c259f5c523433eb39f8531fe5703f947192493678b76d544b79d7959b854583</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T14:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/protests-and-reforms-france-s-rising-debt-costs-threaten-stability/a-79865654--ed74af6123ad.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/protests-and-reforms-france-s-rising-debt-costs-threaten-stability/a-79865654?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">France plans to spend an extra €4 billion on education amid nationwide protests. But with public debt mounting and interest costs climbing, how much fiscal room does the government have?</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Czech arms makers set sights on space defense in bid to sustain Ukraine-driven arms boom</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8cda5df648ca9b59bc04e0328bd4cac931f25c08bfb6bfb2c2546b4abed021bb</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T14:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/czech-arms-makers-set-sights-on-space-defense-in-bid-to-sustain-ukraine-driven-arms-boom/a-79876035--897a0df46a70.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/czech-arms-makers-set-sights-on-space-defense-in-bid-to-sustain-ukraine-driven-arms-boom/a-79876035?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Czech arms makers have thrived on demand linked to the war in Ukraine. To sustain their growth, they need to look beyond ammunition and toward new technologies — and even space.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Zambia's civil service overhaul raises questions</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fdb6637ad7152c95d919d3bac50124f8ddd96690f570061717c4c85733d4a08c</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T13:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/zambia-s-civil-service-overhaul-raises-questions/a-79875892--d33c313a06f4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/zambia-s-civil-service-overhaul-raises-questions/a-79875892?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Government-backed retirements and institutional realignments are fueling debate in Zambia, with opposition politicians questioning transparency while officials defend the changes as necessary reforms.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>What to know about the IIHF Women's Ice Hockey World Championship</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a5e0a14396bda894cf08fe82989d9c8e34651344e5fc80a9952475ccf515417b</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T13:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-to-know-about-the-iihf-women-s-ice-hockey-world-championship/a-79876148--d773b0d8af6c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-to-know-about-the-iihf-women-s-ice-hockey-world-championship/a-79876148?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As ice hockey's governing body continues to wrangle over how to respond to a CAS order to reinstate Russia to international play, the top women's tournament gets underway in Denmark without Russia.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Global temperatures are set to exceed 1.5 degrees above pre-industrial levels in 2026, likely the second-warmest year on record</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:294c8e74cd65801e548bff56226523fe151dfbf8c1fecd3129b984223efe6aa0</id><updated>2026-11-07T06:14:31Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T13:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/global-temperatures-are-set-to-exceed-1-5-degrees-above-pre-industrial-levels-in-2026-likely-the-sec/a-79874098--d560bb827fee.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/global-temperatures-are-set-to-exceed-1-5-degrees-above-pre-industrial-levels-in-2026-likely-the-second-warmest-year-on-record/a-79874098?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Climate scientists say the world is set to breach the critical 1.5-degree Celsius threshold in 2026. This year is also on track to become the second-warmest on record.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
